# Teim on Nido F2 (object $2A at 47,31): Obj_Teim's init sets $2C to 4,
# an A-button event, and her index byte is $17, so A on her is
# ObjType_Events $17 (loc_DC36, ps2.asm:20180). Without the Letter:
# "I'm Teim, daughter of Darum ..." ($1807) in the big box. With it:
# "{char} hands over {item}; Teim's hands are shaking ..." ($1808), then
# loc_DC64 sets event_flags[$17] -- Obj_Teim's init takes her off the
# level once $C727 is set -- trades the Letter for Teim in the same bag
# and plays SXFID_ItemReceived. Before build 68 A on her was the plain
# "There seems to be nothing unusual here." ($1708) and "level: event
# $17 is not ported" on stderr.

start level 29 47 33         # Nido F2, below Teim's room, a new game
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 1                    # 47,32: she stands on 47,31
wait step
expect level 29 47 32
shot 01_teim
press a
wait idle
expect script $1807          # no Letter yet
shot 02_no_letter
press c                      # the second page
wait idle
press c                      # the box closes ($DE72 was set)
wait idle
expect level 29 47 32
give Letter
press a
wait idle
expect script $1808          # the Letter handed over
shot 03_letter
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect level 29 47 32
bags                         # Rolf: ... Teim, the Letter gone
shot 04_gone                 # $C727 set: Obj_Teim's init deletes her
walk up 1                    # where she stood
wait step
expect level 29 47 31
expect no-stderr not ported
